Package: alx-desktop-awesome
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, awesome, rofi, dunst, pcmanfm, rxvt-unicode, sddm, alx-branding
Description: ALX Awesome WM desktop configuration and dark theme
 Provides the default Awesome WM Lua configuration (5 tags, 28px top wibar
 with /proc and sysfs widgets, PNG ASCII wallpapers via gears.wallpaper),
 dunst, rofi, GTK dark theme, and urxvt configurations under /etc/skel, plus
 the Super+? keybinding cheat-sheet for Algothix OS (ALX) Lite.
